                                "sense_id": "ce4aa12b-f90a-32f7-9626-cd5209cf9e31",
                                "text": "The intellectual colonization of America by England has been going on for generations. Taking advantage of her position of authority — a position built on centuries of aesthetic tradition — England has let pass few opportunities to ridicule and disparage our activities in all lines of creative effort, and to impress upon us her own assumed cultural superiority."
